re code review and SDLC uplift</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</span><span class=\"nav__link-blurb\">24/7 SOC on your telemetry</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">GRC &amp; Compliance</span><span class=\"nav__link-blurb\">SOC 2, ISO 27001, PCI DSS, DORA, NIS2</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/services/custom-software\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Custom Software</span><span class=\"nav__link-blurb\">Systems built to survive an audit</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/services/engagement-models\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Engagement Models</span><span class=\"nav__link-blurb\">How retainers and projects actually run</span></a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__panel-foot\"><a class=\"nav__panel-all\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/services\">All <!-- -->services<!-- --> →</a></div></div></li><li><button id=\"radix-_R_klb_-trigger-Industries\" data-state=\"closed\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_klb_-content-Industries\" class=\"nav__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">Industries<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down nav__trigger-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div id=\"radix-_R_klb_-content-Industries\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_klb_-trigger-Industries\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"nav__panel\" style=\"pointer-events:none\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"nav__panel-grid\"><ul class=\"nav__links\"><li><a class=