atured-label\">Anatomy of a report</span><span class=\"nav__featured-blurb\">Walk a real deliverable, redacted. See what actually lands in your inbox.</span></a><ul class=\"nav__links\"><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/case-studies\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Case Studies</span><span class=\"nav__link-blurb\">24 stories, filterable</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/customers\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Customers</span><span class=\"nav__link-blurb\">Who we work with, and what they say</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/certifications\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Certifications</span><span class=\"nav__link-blurb\">Ours, with certificate numbers</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/trust\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Trust Centre</span><span class=\"nav__link-blurb\">Our own security posture, published</span></a></li></ul></div></div></li><li><button id=\"radix-_R_klb_-trigger-Resources\" data-state=\"closed\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_klb_-content-Resources\" class=\"nav__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">Resources<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down nav__trigger-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div id=\"radix-_R_klb_-content-Resources\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_klb_-trigger-Resources\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"nav__panel\" style=\"pointer-events:none\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"nav__panel-grid\"><ul class=\"nav__links\"><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/resources\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">All resources</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/blog\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Insights</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/research\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Research &amp; Labs</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/tools\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Open-source tools</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/methodologies\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Methodologies</span></a></li></ul></div></div></li><li><button id=\"radix-_R_klb_-trigger-Company\" data-state=\"closed\" aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-controls=\"radix-_R_klb_-content-Company\" class=\"nav__trigger\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\">Company<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down nav__trigger-chevron\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button><div id=\"radix-_R_klb_-content-Company\" aria-labelledby=\"radix-_R_klb_-trigger-Company\" data-orientation=\"horizontal\" data-state=\"closed\" class=\"nav__panel\" style=\"pointer-events:none\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"nav__panel-grid\"><ul class=\"nav__links\"><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/about\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">About</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/about/leadership\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Leadership</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/approach\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">The Adversary Loop</span><span class=\"nav__link-blurb\">How we actually work</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/careers\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Careers</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__link\" data-radix-collection-item=\"\" href=\"/newsroom\"><span class=\"nav__link-label\">Newsroom</span></a></li></ul></div></div></li></ul></div></nav><div class=\"nav__actions\"><a class=\"nav__hotline\" href=\"tel:+442045259100\" data-ir-hotline=\"nav\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone nav__hotline-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg><span class=\"nav__hotline-text\"><span class=\"nav__hotline-kicker\">Breach? 24/7</span><span class=\"nav__hotline-number\">+44 20 4525 9100</span></span></a><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--sm nav__cta\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span></a><details class=\"nav__mobile\"><summary class=\"nav__burger\" aria-label=\"Navigation menu\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu nav__burger-open\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-x nav__burger-close\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M18 6 6 18\"></path><path d=\"m6 6 12 12\"></path></svg></summary><nav class=\"nav__sheet\" aria-label=\"All pages\"><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Services</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/devsecops\">Secure SDLC<span class=\"nav__sheet-blurb\">The page that explains why one firm does both. Start here.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/cybersecurity\">Cybersecurity</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/software-development\">Software Development</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\">GRC &amp; Compliance</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Custom Software</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services/engagement-models\">Engagement Models</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/services\">All <!-- -->services</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Industries</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/financial-services\">Financial Services</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/healthcare\">Healthcare</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/saas\">SaaS &amp; Technology</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/logistics\">Logistics</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/public-sector\">Public Sector</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries/retail\">Retail &amp; Payments</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/industries\">All <!-- -->industries</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Proof</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/sample-report\">Anatomy of a report<span class=\"nav__sheet-blurb\">Walk a real deliverable, redacted. See what actually lands in your inbox.</span></a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/case-studies\">Case Studies</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/customers\">Customers</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/certifications\">Certifications</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/trust\">Trust Centre</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Resources</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/resources\">All resources</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/blog\">Insights</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/research\">Research &amp; Labs</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/tools\">Open-source tools</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/methodologies\">Methodologies</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-group\"><p class=\"nav__sheet-heading\">Company</p><ul class=\"nav__sheet-list\"><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/about/leadership\">Leadership</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/approach\">The Adversary Loop</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/careers\">Careers</a></li><li><a class=\"nav__sheet-link\" href=\"/newsroom\">Newsroom</a></li></ul></div><div class=\"nav__sheet-cta\"><a class=\"btn btn--primary btn--md btn--full\" href=\"/contact\"><span>Start a conversation</span></a><a class=\"nav__sheet-hotline\" href=\"tel:+442045259100\">Incident response, 24/7 — <!-- -->+44 20 4525 9100</a></div></nav></details></div></div></header><main id=\"main\"><section class=\"sec theme-dark transition-theme u-section grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\" style=\"padding-top:calc(var(--nav-h) + var(--s16))\" aria-labelledby=\"trust-title\"><div class=\"u-container\"><p class=\"u-eyebrow\">Trust centre</p><h1 id=\"trust-title\" style=\"font-size:clamp(2.25rem, 5.2vw, 4rem);max-width:20ch;margin-top:var(--s4)\">What we do with your systems, your code and your data</h1><p class=\"u-measure\" style=\"color:var(--muted-strong);font-size:var(--text-lg);margin-top:var(--s6)\">We ask clients to let our engineers read their source and our testers reach their production systems. That is a significant thing to ask for, and the reasonable response is to ask what we do with it. This page answers that without a form, a sales call or an NDA.</p><p class=\"trust_heroNote___QH3J\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s8)\">Where a control below is scoped, the scope is stated. Where something is not yet in place, it says so. A trust page that claims everything is a trust page nobody believes.</p><ul class=\"trust_heroLinks__1smnP\" style=\"margin-top:var(--s12)\"><li><a class=\"btn btn--secondary btn--md\" href=\"/certifications\"><span>Certificates and numbers</span></a></li><li><a class=\"btn btn--ghost btn--md\" href=\"/legal/vulnerability-disclosure\"><span>Vulnerability disclosure policy</span></a></li></ul><p style=\"margin-top:var(--s6)\"><a class=\"u-link u-mono\" href=\"/.well-known/security.txt\" style=\"color:var(--muted-strong)\">/.well-known/security.txt<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"display:inline-block;vertical-align:-2px;margin-left:4px\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></a></p></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-light transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"light\"><div class=\"u-container trust_layout__6Brbs\"><nav class=\"trust_indexWrap__wfK25\" aria-label=\"Sections of this document\"><h2 class=\"trust_indexHeading__Avsfl\">On this page</h2><ol class=\"trust_indexList__gOc9D\"><li><a class=\"trust_indexLink__CY2nq\" href=\"#certifications\"><span class=\"u-mono trust_indexNum__S_6U4\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span><span>Our own certifications</span></a></li><li><a class=\"trust_indexLink__CY2nq\" href=\"#people\"><span class=\"u-mono trust_indexNum__S_6U4\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span><span>Who touches your systems</span></a></li><li><a class=\"trust_indexLink__CY2nq\" href=\"#your-data\"><span class=\"u-mono trust_indexNum__S_6U4\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span><span>Your data and your evidence</span></a></li><li><a class=\"trust_indexLink__CY2nq\" href=\"#sub-processors\"><span class=\"u-mono trust_indexNum__S_6U4\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span><span>Sub-processors</span></a></li><li><a class=\"trust_indexLink__CY2nq\" href=\"#our-posture\"><span class=\"u-mono trust_indexNum__S_6U4\" aria-hidden=\"true\">05</span><span>How we test ourselves</span></a></li><li><a class=\"trust_indexLink__CY2nq\" href=\"#resilience\"><span class=\"u-mono trust_indexNum__S_6U4\" aria-hidden=\"true\">06</span><span>Availability and continuity</span></a></li><li><a class=\"trust_indexLink__CY2nq\" href=\"#incidents\"><span class=\"u-mono trust_indexNum__S_6U4\" aria-hidden=\"true\">07</span><span>Our incident history</span></a></li><li><a class=\"trust_indexLink__CY2nq\" href=\"#trust-contacts\"><span class=\"u-mono trust_indexNum__S_6U4\" aria-hidden=\"true\">08</span><span>Contacts</span></a></li></ol></nav><div class=\"trust_doc__vgtGj\"><section data-reveal=\"\" id=\"certifications\" class=\"trust_docSection__iQjuL\" aria-labelledby=\"certifications-heading\"><div class=\"trust_sectionTop__xp2wT\"><span class=\"u-mono trust_sectionNum__4xRWr\" aria-hidden=\"true\">01</span><h2 id=\"certifications-heading\" class=\"trust_sectionHeading__amV4K\">Our own certifications</h2></div><p class=\"trust_summary__xvzO7\">ISO/IEC 27001:2022 and SOC 2 Type II, both scoped to the delivery of client engagements rather than to a convenient subset.</p><div class=\"trust_tableWrap__Yf7Hg\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"certifications-heading\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"trust_spec__UPXf1\"><caption class=\"trust_srOnly__PcgD2\">ISO/IEC 27001:2022 and SOC 2 Type II, both scoped to the delivery of client engagements rather than to a convenient subset.</caption><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">ISO/IEC 27001:2022</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Certified</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">Scope: delivery of cybersecurity and software development services, London and Dhaka. Certificate number and UKAS-accredited body named on <a class=\"u-link u-mono\" href=\"/certifications\">/certifications</a>.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">SOC 2 Type II</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Report available under NDA</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">Security, Availability and Confidentiality criteria. Twelve-month observation window.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Cyber Essentials Plus</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Certified</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">Whole organisation, audited technical controls, annual.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">ISO 9001:2015</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Certified</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">Scope: software development delivery.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">ISO/IEC 27701</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Not held</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">Privacy controls are operated under the 27001 ISMS. We have not sought separate 27701 certification and will say so rather than implying it.</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section data-reveal=\"\" id=\"people\" class=\"trust_docSection__iQjuL\" aria-labelledby=\"people-heading\"><div class=\"trust_sectionTop__xp2wT\"><span class=\"u-mono trust_sectionNum__4xRWr\" aria-hidden=\"true\">02</span><h2 id=\"people-heading\" class=\"trust_sectionHeading__amV4K\">Who touches your systems</h2></div><p class=\"trust_summary__xvzO7\">Every engineer and tester is background-checked before they are assigned to an engagement, and the policy is published here rather than described on request.</p><div class=\"trust_tableWrap__Yf7Hg\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"people-heading\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"trust_spec__UPXf1\"><caption class=\"trust_srOnly__PcgD2\">Every engineer and tester is background-checked before they are assigned to an engagement, and the policy is published here rather than described on request.</caption><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Identity and right to work</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Verified for all staff before start date</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Basic criminal record check</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">All staff</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">DBS Basic in the UK; local equivalent elsewhere. Renewed every three years.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Enhanced screening</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">BS 7858 for staff on financial services and public sector engagements</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">Five-year employment history, two references, credit and sanctions check.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Confidentiality</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Individual NDA signed at onboarding, surviving termination</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Subcontractors</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Rare, always disclosed before an engagement starts</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">Held to the same screening standard, named in the statement of work. We do not subcontract testing without telling you who to.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Leaver process</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Access revoked across identity, devices and client systems on the last working day</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">Completion tracked; exceptions escalated to the COO. Stale credentials belonging to former staff is one of the most common findings in our own internal testing, so we audit ours quarterly.</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section data-reveal=\"\" id=\"your-data\" class=\"trust_docSection__iQjuL\" aria-labelledby=\"your-data-heading\"><div class=\"trust_sectionTop__xp2wT\"><span class=\"u-mono trust_sectionNum__4xRWr\" aria-hidden=\"true\">03</span><h2 id=\"your-data-heading\" class=\"trust_sectionHeading__amV4K\">Your data and your evidence</h2></div><p class=\"trust_summary__xvzO7\">Engagement evidence lives in a per-engagement encrypted workspace in the region you specify, and is destroyed 90 days after the retest unless you ask us to hold it.</p><div class=\"trust_tableWrap__Yf7Hg\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"your-data-heading\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"trust_spec__UPXf1\"><caption class=\"trust_srOnly__PcgD2\">Engagement evidence lives in a per-engagement encrypted workspace in the region you specify, and is destroyed 90 days after the retest unless you ask us to hold it.</caption><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Isolation</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">One workspace per engagement</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">No shared evidence store. A tester on one engagement cannot reach another engagement’s evidence.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Access</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Named engagement team only, reviewed at engagement close</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Encryption</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">AES-256 at rest, TLS 1.3 in transit</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">Customer-managed keys available on request for retainer clients.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Residency</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">UK or EU by default; other regions on request</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">Stated in the statement of work before work starts, not negotiated afterwards.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Retention</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Destroyed 90 days after retest</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">Extended only on your written instruction, for example to support an audit. Destruction is logged and the log is available to you.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Source code</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Read-only access, scoped to the engagement, for the engagement duration</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">Cloned only into the engagement workspace. We can work in your environment on your hardware where your policy requires it.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Production access</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Time-boxed, logged, and revoked at engagement close</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">We ask for the least access that makes the engagement possible and will tell you when a scope reduction would cost you coverage.</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section data-reveal=\"\" id=\"sub-processors\" class=\"trust_docSection__iQjuL\" aria-labelledby=\"sub-processors-heading\"><div class=\"trust_sectionTop__xp2wT\"><span class=\"u-mono trust_sectionNum__4xRWr\" aria-hidden=\"true\">04</span><h2 id=\"sub-processors-heading\" class=\"trust_sectionHeading__amV4K\">Sub-processors</h2></div><p class=\"trust_summary__xvzO7\">The full list, with what each one processes and where. Material additions are notified 30 days in advance.</p><div class=\"trust_tableWrap__Yf7Hg\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"sub-processors-heading\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"trust_spec__UPXf1\"><caption class=\"trust_srOnly__PcgD2\">The full list, with what each one processes and where. Material additions are notified 30 days in advance.</caption><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Amazon Web Services</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Engagement workspaces, evidence storage — eu-west-2 (London)</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Microsoft 365</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Email, documents, internal collaboration — UK and EU tenancy</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Atlassian</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Engagement tracking — EU data residency</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Slack</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Client engagement channels — EU data residency, Enterprise Key Management</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Zoom</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Scoping and debrief calls — recordings disabled by default</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">1Password</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Credential management — zero-knowledge architecture</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">DocuSign</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Contracts and attestation letters — EU</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"trust_body__u9U_A\"><p>We do not use client data to train any model, we do not send client code or evidence to a third-party AI service, and no sub-processor above has access to engagement evidence except AWS as the storage provider.</p><p>A current, dated version of this list with each processor’s role, location and transfer mechanism is available as a signed PDF for your DPA annex.</p></div></section><section data-reveal=\"\" id=\"our-posture\" class=\"trust_docSection__iQjuL\" aria-labelledby=\"our-posture-heading\"><div class=\"trust_sectionTop__xp2wT\"><span class=\"u-mono trust_sectionNum__4xRWr\" aria-hidden=\"true\">05</span><h2 id=\"our-posture-heading\" class=\"trust_sectionHeading__amV4K\">How we test ourselves</h2></div><p class=\"trust_summary__xvzO7\">We buy an annual external penetration test and a red team from a competitor, and we publish the cadence rather than the results.</p><div class=\"trust_tableWrap__Yf7Hg\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"our-posture-heading\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"trust_spec__UPXf1\"><caption class=\"trust_srOnly__PcgD2\">We buy an annual external penetration test and a red team from a competitor, and we publish the cadence rather than the results.</caption><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">External penetration test</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Annual, by an independent CREST-accredited firm</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">Not by us. A firm that only tests itself is not telling you anything.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Red team</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Every 24 months, independent provider</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Internal testing</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Quarterly, by a team not responsible for the systems tested</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Secure development</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Our own products go through the same secure SDLC we sell</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">Threat model before build, security review on each architectural decision, independent pre-release test.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Vulnerability disclosure</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Published policy, no NDA required to report</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">Acknowledged within one business day, triage decision within five. See <a class=\"u-link u-mono\" href=\"/legal/vulnerability-disclosure\">/legal/vulnerability-disclosure</a>.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Patch cadence</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Critical within 7 days, high within 30</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">Measured against the date a fix becomes available, not the date we noticed.</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section data-reveal=\"\" id=\"resilience\" class=\"trust_docSection__iQjuL\" aria-labelledby=\"resilience-heading\"><div class=\"trust_sectionTop__xp2wT\"><span class=\"u-mono trust_sectionNum__4xRWr\" aria-hidden=\"true\">06</span><h2 id=\"resilience-heading\" class=\"trust_sectionHeading__amV4K\">Availability and continuity</h2></div><p class=\"trust_summary__xvzO7\">We are a services firm, not a platform — the thing that must stay available is our ability to respond, and that is a people problem before it is an infrastructure one.</p><div class=\"trust_tableWrap__Yf7Hg\" role=\"region\" aria-labelledby=\"resilience-heading\" tabindex=\"0\"><table class=\"trust_spec__UPXf1\"><caption class=\"trust_srOnly__PcgD2\">We are a services firm, not a platform — the thing that must stay available is our ability to respond, and that is a people problem before it is an infrastructure one.</caption><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">Incident response availability</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">24/7/365, nine-person analyst rota</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">Rota depth is the real continuity control. A single on-call responder is a single point of failure.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Business continuity plan</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Tested twice a year, including a full loss-of-office scenario</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Backup and restore</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Restores tested quarterly, not just backups monitored</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">A backup job reporting success is not evidence of a recoverable backup. We have found that exact failure on client engagements and we test for it on our own systems.</span></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">Engagement continuity</th><td><span class=\"trust_value__8TOAJ\">Every engagement has a named deputy</span><span class=\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\">So an illness or a resignation does not stall your work.</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div></section><section data-reveal=\"\" id=\"incidents\" class=\"trust_docSection__iQjuL\" aria-labelledby=\"incidents-heading\"><div class=\"trust_sectionTop__xp2wT\"><span class=\"u-mono trust_sectionNum__4xRWr\" aria-hidden=\"true\">07</span><h2 id=\"incidents-heading\" class=\"trust_sectionHeading__amV4K\">Our incident history</h2></div><div class=\"trust_equalPair__GEea4\"><div class=\"trust_equalPanel__X1I24\"><p class=\"trust_equalLabel__PDKLe\">The record</p><p class=\"trust_equalBody__ezPwj\">No security incident affecting client data to date. If that changes, this is where it will be recorded, and you will hear from us before you read it here.</p></div><div class=\"trust_equalPanel__X1I24\"><p class=\"trust_equalLabel__PDKLe\">The commitment</p><p class=\"trust_equalBody__ezPwj\">Notification commitment: we will notify an affected client within 24 hours of confirming an incident that affects their data or systems, with what we know at that point rather than waiting for a complete picture. Regulatory notification obligations under UK GDPR Article 33 and NIS2 are met in parallel, not instead.</p></div></div><div class=\"trust_body__u9U_A\"><p>A trust page that has only ever said &quot;no incidents&quot; and has no stated commitment about what happens when there is one is not telling you much. The commitment is the part you can hold us to.</p></div></section></div></div></section><section class=\"sec theme-deep transition-theme u-section\" data-theme-section=\"deep\" id=\"trust-contacts\" aria-labelledby=\"trust-contacts-heading\"><div class=\"u-container\"><h2 id=\"trust-contacts-heading\" style=\"font-size:var(--text-3xl);max-width:20ch\">Ask us something this page does not answer</h2><dl class=\"reveal-group trust_contacts__1jzkd\"><div data-reveal=\"\" class=\"trust_contactRow__4t7yS\"><dt class=\"trust_contactLabel__MUFZu\">Security questionnaires and customer security reviews</dt><dd class=\"trust_contactValue__vqwkW\"><a class=\"u-link u-mono\" href=\"mailto:security@envenox.com\">security@envenox.com</a> — we answer from one source of truth rather than re-deriving each time</dd></div><div data-reveal=\"\" class=\"trust_contactRow__4t7yS\"><dt class=\"trust_contactLabel__MUFZu\">Data protection and DPAs</dt><dd class=\"trust_contactValue__vqwkW\"><a class=\"u-link u-mono\" href=\"mailto:privacy@envenox.com\">privacy@envenox.com</a></dd></div><div data-reveal=\"\" class=\"trust_contactRow__4t7yS\"><dt class=\"trust_contactLabel__MUFZu\">Report a vulnerability in our own systems</dt><dd class=\"trust_contactValue__vqwkW\"><a class=\"u-link u-mono\" href=\"mailto:security@envenox.com\">security@envenox.com</a>, no NDA required</dd></div></dl><ul class=\"trust_refs__ljfGj\"><li><a class=\"u-link trust_refLink__3K4TS\" href=\"/certifications\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-check2 lucide-file-check-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 22h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7l-5-5H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"m3 15 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>Every certificate we hold, with its number, issuer and expiry</a></li><li><a class=\"u-link trust_refLink__3K4TS\" href=\"/legal/vulnerability-disclosure\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-check2 lucide-file-check-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 22h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7l-5-5H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"m3 15 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>How to report a vulnerability in our own systems — no NDA required</a></li><li><a class=\"u-link trust_refLink__3K4TS\" href=\"/.well-known/security.txt\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-check2 lucide-file-check-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 22h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7l-5-5H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"m3 15 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg><span class=\"u-mono\">/.well-known/security.txt</span></a></li><li><a class=\"u-link trust_refLink__3K4TS\" href=\"/approach\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-file-check2 lucide-file-check-2\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 22h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7l-5-5H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4\"></path><path d=\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"></path><path d=\"m3 15 2 2 4-4\"></path></svg>The Adversary Loop<!-- --> — the method these controls are built into</a></li></ul></div></section><!--$--><!--/$--></main><footer class=\"foot theme-dark transition-theme grain\" data-theme-section=\"dark\"><div class=\"u-container\"><div class=\"foot__top\"><div class=\"foot__brand\"><a class=\"foot__wordmark\" href=\"/\">Envenox</a><p class=\"foot__positioning\">Envenox is a software development firm. We ship production systems — custom software, web applications, ERP and the platforms underneath them — and we keep an offensive security practice on staff that attacks what we build before anyone else gets the chance.</p><a class=\"foot__hotline\" href=\"tel:+442045259100\" data-ir-hotline=\"footer\"><span class=\"foot__hotline-row\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.1\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-phone\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M13.832 16.568a1 1 0 0 0 1.213-.303l.355-.465A2 2 0 0 1 17 15h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-2 2A18 18 0 0 1 2 4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v3a2 2 0 0 1-.8 1.6l-.468.351a1 1 0 0 0-.292 1.233 14 14 0 0 0 6.392 6.384\"></path></svg><span class=\"u-eyebrow\">Incident response — 24/7</span></span><span class=\"foot__hotline-number\">+44 20 4525 9100</span><span class=\"foot__hotline-note\">Answered by a responder, 24/7. Median pickup under 4 minutes.</span></a></div><nav class=\"foot__cols\" aria-label=\"Footer\"><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Cybersecurity</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/penetration-testing\">Penetration Testing</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/application-security\">Application Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/cloud-security\">Cloud Security</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/red-teaming\">Red Teaming</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/managed-detection-response\">Managed Detection &amp; Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/incident-response\">Incident Response</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/grc-compliance\">GRC &amp; Compliance</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/vciso\">vCISO</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Software Development</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/custom-software\">Custom Software</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/web-application-development\">Web Applications</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/platform-engineering\">Platform &amp; DevOps</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/erp\">ERP</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/crm\">CRM</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/hrm\">HRM</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/lms\">LMS</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/services/qa-automation\">QA &amp; Test Automation</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Company</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/about\">About</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/about/leadership\">Leadership</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/approach\">The Adversary Loop</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/careers\">Careers</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/newsroom\">Newsroom</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/locations\">Locations</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/partners\">Partners</a></li></ul></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Proof &amp; Resources</h2><ul class=\"foot__list\"><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/case-studies\">Case Studies</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/sample-report\">Sample Report</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/customers\">Customers</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/certifications\">Certifications</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/trust\">Trust Centre</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/blog\">Insights</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__link\" href=\"/research\">Research &amp; Labs</a></li></ul></div></nav></div><div class=\"foot__mid\"><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Offices</h2><div class=\"foot__offices\"><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>London<!-- -->, <!-- -->United Kingdom</p><address class=\"foot__office-line\">1 Fore Street Avenue, London EC2Y 9DT</address></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>Dhaka<!-- -->, <!-- -->Bangladesh</p><address class=\"foot__office-line\">Level 7, Bay’s Galleria, Gulshan 1, Dhaka 1212</address></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>General enquiries</p><p class=\"foot__office-line\"><a class=\"foot__link u-link\" href=\"mailto:hello@envenox.com\">hello@envenox.com</a></p></div><div><p class=\"foot__office-city\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m22 7-8.991 5.727a2 2 0 0 1-2.009 0L2 7\"></path><rect x=\"2\" y=\"4\" width=\"20\" height=\"16\" rx=\"2\"></rect></svg>Security reports</p><p class=\"foot__office-line\"><a class=\"foot__link u-link\" href=\"mailto:security@envenox.com\">security@envenox.com</a></p></div></div></div><div><h2 class=\"foot__col-heading\">Research notes</h2><form class=\"foot__form\" action=\"/api/newsletter\" method=\"post\"><label class=\"foot__form-label\" for=\"footer-newsletter-email\">Email address</label><div class=\"foot__form-row\"><input class=\"foot__input\" id=\"footer-newsletter-email\" type=\"email\" autoComplete=\"email\" required=\"\" aria-describedby=\"footer-newsletter-hint\" name=\"email\"/><button class=\"foot__submit\" type=\"submit\">Subscribe</button></div><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"source\" value=\"footer\"/><p class=\"foot__form-hint\" id=\"footer-newsletter-hint\">Advisories, teardowns and methodology notes. Roughly monthly. No sales sequence, one-click unsubscribe.</p></form></div></div><div class=\"foot__bottom\"><div class=\"foot__legal\"><p class=\"foot__legal-line\">© <!-- -->2026<!-- --> <!-- -->Envenox Ltd<!-- -->. Registered in England and Wales. Registered office:<!-- --> <!-- -->1 Fore Street Avenue, London EC2Y 9DT<!-- -->.</p><ul class=\"foot__legal-nav\"><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/privacy\">Privacy</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/cookies\">Cookies</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/terms\">Terms</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/accessibility\">Accessibility</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/legal/vulnerability-disclosure\">Vulnerability disclosure</a></li><li><a class=\"foot__legal-link\" href=\"/sitemap\">Sitemap</a></li></ul></div><ul class=\"foot__social\"><li><a class=\"foot__social-link\" href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/envenox\" rel=\"me noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>LinkedIn</span><span class=\"foot__vh\"> (opens in a new tab)</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2.625\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></a></li><li><a class=\"foot__social-link\" href=\"https://github.com/envenox\" rel=\"me noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><g transform=\"translate(2.16 2.16) scale(0.82)\"><path d=\"M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385.6.113.82-.258.82-.577 0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61C4.422 18.07 3.633 17.7 3.633 17.7c-1.087-.744.084-.729.084-.729 1.205.084 1.838 1.236 1.838 1.236 1.07 1.835 2.809 1.305 3.495.998.108-.776.417-1.305.76-1.605-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93 0-1.31.465-2.38 1.235-3.22-.135-.303-.54-1.523.105-3.176 0 0 1.005-.322 3.3 1.23.96-.267 1.98-.399 3-.405 1.02.006 2.04.138 3 .405 2.28-1.552 3.285-1.23 3.285-1.23.645 1.653.24 2.873.12 3.176.765.84 1.23 1.91 1.23 3.22 0 4.61-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.92.42.36.81 1.096.81 2.22 0 1.606-.01