 to train any model, we\",{\"children\":[\"We do not use client data to train any model, we do not send client code or evidence to a third-party AI service, and no sub-processor above has access to engagement evidence except AWS as the storage provider.\"]}],[\"$\",\"p\",\"A current, dated version of this list with each \",{\"children\":[\"A current, dated version of this list with each processor’s role, location and transfer mechanism is available as a signed PDF for your DPA annex.\"]}]]}]]]}]\n2f:[\"$\",\"$L26\",\"our-posture\",{\"as\":\"section\",\"id\":\"our-posture\",\"className\":\"trust_docSection__iQjuL\",\"aria-labelledby\":\"our-posture-heading\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_sectionTop__xp2wT\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"u-mono trust_sectionNum__4xRWr\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":\"05\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"our-posture-heading\",\"className\":\"trust_sectionHeading__amV4K\",\"children\":\"How we test ourselves\"}]]}],[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_summary__xvzO7\",\"children\":\"We buy an annual external penetration test and a red team from a competitor, and we publish the cadence rather than the results.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_tableWrap__Yf7Hg\",\"role\":\"region\",\"aria-labelledby\":\"our-posture-heading\",\"tabIndex\":0,\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_spec__UPXf1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"caption\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_srOnly__PcgD2\",\"children\":\"We buy an annual external penetration test and a red team from a competitor, and we publish the cadence rather than the results.\"}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"External penetration test\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"scope\":\"row\",\"children\":\"External penetration test\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_value__8TOAJ\",\"children\":\"Annual, by an independent CREST-accredited firm\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\",\"children\":[\"Not by us. A firm that only tests itself is not telling you anything.\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"Red team\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"scope\":\"row\",\"children\":\"Red team\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_value__8TOAJ\",\"children\":\"Every 24 months, independent provider\"}],null]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"Internal testing\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"scope\":\"row\",\"children\":\"Internal testing\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_value__8TOAJ\",\"children\":\"Quarterly, by a team not responsible for the systems tested\"}],null]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"Secure development\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"scope\":\"row\",\"children\":\"Secure development\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_value__8TOAJ\",\"children\":\"Our own products go through the same secure SDLC we sell\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\",\"children\":[\"Threat model before build, security review on each architectural decision, independent pre-release test.\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"Vulnerability disclosure\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"scope\":\"row\",\"children\":\"Vulnerability disclosure\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_value__8TOAJ\",\"children\":\"Published policy, no NDA required to report\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\",\"children\":[\"Acknowledged within one business day, triage decision within five. See \",[\"$\",\"$Ld\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"u-link u-mono\",\"href\":\"/legal/vulnerability-disclosure\",\"children\":\"/legal/vulnerability-disclosure\"}],\".\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"Patch cadence\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"scope\":\"row\",\"children\":\"Patch cadence\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_value__8TOAJ\",\"children\":\"Critical within 7 days, high within 30\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\",\"children\":[\"Measured against the date a fix becomes available, not the date we noticed.\"]}]]}]]}]]}]]}]}],null]]}]\n30:[\"$\",\"$L26\",\"resilience\",{\"as\":\"section\",\"id\":\"resilience\",\"className\":\"trust_docSection__iQjuL\",\"aria-labelledby\":\"resilience-heading\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_sectionTop__xp2wT\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"u-mono trust_sectionNum__4xRWr\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":\"06\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"resilience-heading\",\"className\":\"trust_sectionHeading__amV4K\",\"children\":\"Availability and continuity\"}]]}],[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_summary__xvzO7\",\"children\":\"We are a services firm, not a platform — the thing that must stay available is our ability to respond, and that is a people problem before it is an infrastructure one.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_tableWrap__Yf7Hg\",\"role\":\"region\",\"aria-labelledby\":\"resilience-heading\",\"tabIndex\":0,\"children\":[\"$\",\"table\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_spec__UPXf1\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"caption\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_srOnly__PcgD2\",\"children\":\"We are a services firm, not a platform — the thing that must stay available is our ability to respond, and that is a people problem before it is an infrastructure one.\"}],[\"$\",\"tbody\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"tr\",\"Incident response availability\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"scope\":\"row\",\"children\":\"Incident response availability\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_value__8TOAJ\",\"children\":\"24/7/365, nine-person analyst rota\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\",\"children\":[\"Rota depth is the real continuity control. A single on-call responder is a single point of failure.\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"Business continuity plan\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"scope\":\"row\",\"children\":\"Business continuity plan\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_value__8TOAJ\",\"children\":\"Tested twice a year, including a full loss-of-office scenario\"}],null]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"Backup and restore\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"scope\":\"row\",\"children\":\"Backup and restore\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_value__8TOAJ\",\"children\":\"Restores tested quarterly, not just backups monitored\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\",\"children\":[\"A backup job reporting success is not evidence of a recoverable backup. We have found that exact failure on client engagements and we test for it on our own systems.\"]}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"tr\",\"Engagement continuity\",{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"th\",null,{\"scope\":\"row\",\"children\":\"Engagement continuity\"}],[\"$\",\"td\",null,{\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_value__8TOAJ\",\"children\":\"Every engagement has a named deputy\"}],[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_rowNote__NReVA\",\"children\":[\"So an illness or a resignation does not stall your work.\"]}]]}]]}]]}]]}]}],null]]}]\n31:[\"$\",\"$L26\",\"incidents\",{\"as\":\"section\",\"id\":\"incidents\",\"className\":\"trust_docSection__iQjuL\",\"aria-labelledby\":\"incidents-heading\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_sectionTop__xp2wT\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"u-mono trust_sectionNum__4xRWr\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":\"07\"}],[\"$\",\"h2\",null,{\"id\":\"incidents-heading\",\"className\":\"trust_sectionHeading__amV4K\",\"children\":\"Our incident history\"}]]}],[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_equalPair__GEea4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_equalPanel__X1I24\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_equalLabel__PDKLe\",\"children\":\"The record\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_equalBody__ezPwj\",\"children\":\"No security incident affecting client data to date. If that changes, this is where it will be recorded, and you will hear from us before you read it here.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_equalPanel__X1I24\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_equalLabel__PDKLe\",\"children\":\"The commitment\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_equalBody__ezPwj\",\"children\":\"Notification commitment: we will notify an affected client within 24 hours of confirming an incident that affects their data or systems, with what we know at that point rather than waiting for a complete picture. Regulatory notification obligations under UK GDPR Article 33 and NIS2 are met in parallel, not instead.\"}]]}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"trust_body__u9U_A\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"p\",\"A trust page that has only ever said \\\"no inciden\",{\"children\":\"A trust page that has only ever said \\\"no incidents\\\" and has no stated commitment about what happens when there is one is not telling you much. The commitment is the part you can hold us to.\"}]]}]]]}]\n33:[\"$\",\"li\",null,{\"children\":[\"$\",\"$Ld\",null,{\"className\":\"u-link trust_refLink__3K4TS\",\"href\":\"/approach\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":16,\"height\":16,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-file-check2 lucide-file-check-2\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1pf5j1\",{\"d\":\"M4 22h14a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7l-5-5H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v4\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"tnqrlb\",{\"d\":\"M14 2v4a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h4\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"1lhrkk\",{\"d\":\"m3 15 2 2 4-4\"}],\"$undefined\"]}],\"The Adversary Loop\",\" — the method these controls are built into\"]}]}]\n38:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"children\":\"X\"}]\n39:[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"className\":\"foot__vh\",\"children\":\" (opens in a new tab)\"}]\n3a:[\"$\",\"svg\",null,{\"ref\":\"$undefined\",\"xmlns\":\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\",\"width\":16,\"height\":16,\"viewBox\":\"0 0 24 24\",\"fill\":\"none\",\"stroke\":\"currentColor\",\"strokeWidth\":2.625,\"strokeLinecap\":\"round\",\"strokeLinejoin\":\"round\",\"className\":\"lucide lucide-arrow-right\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"path\",\"1ays0h\",{\"d\":\"M5 12h14\"}],[\"$\",\"path\",\"xquz4c\",{\"d\":\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"}],\"$undefined\"]}]\n1b:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, viewport-fit=cover\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"theme-color\",\"content\":\"#0a0d13\"}]]\n35:null\n3b:I[622,[],\"IconMark\"]\n37:{\"metadata\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Trust centre · Envenox\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"Our own security posture, published rather than described on request: certifications, background-check policy, evidence handling, the full sub-processor list, how we test ourselves, and what we commit to if we have an incident.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"2\",{\"name\":\"application-name\",\"content\":\"Envenox\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"3\",{\"rel\":\"author\",\"href\":\"https://envenox.com\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"name\":\"author\",\"content\":\"Envenox Ltd\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"penetration testing,application security,managed detection and response,secure software development,custom software development,ISO 27001,SOC 2,DORA,NIS2\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"name\":\"referrer\",\"content\":\"strict-origin-when-cross-origin\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"name\":\"creator\",\"content\":\"Envenox Ltd\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"name\":\"publisher\",\"content\":\"Envenox Ltd\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"9\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"content\":\"index, follow\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"name\":\"googlebot\",\"content\":\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"11\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://envenox.com/trust\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"name\":\"format-detection\",\"content\":\"telephone=no, address=no, email=no\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"Trust centre · Envenox\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"14\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"We ask clients to let our engineers read their source and our testers reach their production systems. That is a significant thing to ask for, and the reasonable response is to ask what we do with it. This page answers that without a form, a sales call or an NDA.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"15\",{\"property\":\"og:url\",\"content\":\"https://envenox.com/trust\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"16\",{\"name\":\"twitter:card\",\"content\":\"summary_large_image\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"17\",{\"name\":\"twitter:title\",\"content\":\"Envenox — We build the software. Then we try to break it.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"18\",{\"name\":\"twitter:description\",\"content\":\"Envenox is a software development firm. We ship production systems — custom software, web applications, ERP and the platforms underneath them — and we keep an offensive security practice on staff that attacks what we build before anyone else gets the chance.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"19\",{\"rel\":\"icon\",\"href\":\"/icon.svg?0887ae5654435afa\",\"type\":\"image/svg+xml\",\"sizes\":\"any\"}],[\"$\",\"$L3b\",\"20\",{}]],\"error\":null,\"digest\":\"$undefined\"}\n1e:\"$37:metadata\"\n"}